(text "Native USB: disconnect before host sleep/off. ROM/crash does not enforce data isolation."(at 17.78 139.7 0)(effects(font(size 0.95 0.95))(justify left))(uuid 87ce8620-cfef-5812-92d5-ceaf38e883f5))
(text "NO cell sensing: TS 10k bias permitted by TI. Default timers: TMR open. ITERM open. CE/EN1/EN2 grounded."(at 17.78 274.32 0)(effects(font(size 0.9 0.9))(justify left))(uuid 5e9f6675-6244-5c20-8cc4-b000e70999ed))
(text "Charge ONLY supervised, off-body, qualified protected pack and independent bench temperature monitoring. Cell acceptance >=121mA and 4.23V."(at 17.78 279.4 0)(effects(font(size 0.9 0.9))(justify left))(uuid 9f72c3de-c2cc-545f-bf9b-cf1b7e9181f1))
(text "PGOOD_N low = valid USB. Firmware detach on loss. ADC is an LDO headroom screen, NOT a fuel gauge."(at 215.9 203.2 0)(effects(font(size 0.9 0.9))(justify left))(uuid 19f0f65a-3894-5927-a9b0-ec4e42f62904))
(text "PH4: 1=3V3, 2=GND, 3=SDA, 4=SCL\n<=50mm; carrier owns pulls + 1V8 + translation."(at 320.04 40.64 0)(effects(font(size 0.9 0.9))(justify left))(uuid 27fe53a8-b13e-5c9f-832f-0436b7d73f00))
